<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Thiago Meira | Personal Trainer</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --black: #17181A;
    --panel: #232427;
    --panel-2: #1c1d1f;
    --chalk: #F2F1ED;
    --chalk-dim: #A7A6A1;
    --yellow: #F4C10F;
    --red: #C7361B;
    --line: #343537;
    --radius: 2px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background:var(--black);
    color:var(--chalk);
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{animation-duration:0.01ms !important; animation-iteration-count:1 !important; transition-duration:0.01ms !important; scroll-behavior:auto !important;}
  }
  .display{
    font-family:'Anton', sans-serif;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
    line-height:0.92;
  }
  .mono{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
  }
  .wrap{
    max-width:1180px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 32px;
  }
  a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;}
  ::selection{background:var(--yellow); color:var(--black);}

  /* hazard stripe divider */
  .stripe{
    height:10px;
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, var(--yellow), var(--yellow) 14px, var(--black) 14px, var(--black) 28px);
  }

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  header{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    background:rgba(23,24,26,0.92);
    backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  nav{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding:20px 32px;
    max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto;
  }
  .logo{
    font-family:'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-size:22px;
    letter-spacing:0.03em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .logo span{color:var(--yellow);}
  .nav-links{
    display:flex; gap:36px;
    font-size:14px; font-weight:600;
    text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em;
  }
  .nav-links a{
    color:var(--chalk-dim);
    transition:color .2s;
    position:relative;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a:focus-visible{color:var(--chalk);}
  .nav-cta{
    background:var(--yellow); color:var(--black);
    padding:11px 20px;
    font-weight:800; font-size:13px;
    text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.05em;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    transition:transform .15s ease, background .15s ease;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover{background:#ffd23f; transform:translateY(-1px);}
  .burger{display:none;}

  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible{
    outline:2px solid var(--yellow);
    outline-offset:3px;
  }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    position:relative;
    padding:96px 0 72px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 900px 500px at 85% -10%, rgba(244,193,15,0.10), transparent 60%),
      var(--black);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size:64px 64px;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .hero-grid{
    position:relative;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.15fr 0.85fr;
    gap:56px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--yellow);
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{
    content:"";
    width:20px; height:2px;
    background:var(--yellow);
  }
  h1.hero-title{
    font-size:clamp(48px, 6.4vw, 84px);
    color:var(--chalk);
  }
  h1.hero-title .accent{color:var(--yellow);}
  .hero-sub{
    margin-top:24px;
    font-size:18px; line-height:1.6;
    color:var(--chalk-dim);
    max-width:480px;
  }
  .hero-actions{
    margin-top:36px;
    display:flex; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    padding:16px 28px;
    font-weight:800; font-size:14.5px;
    text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.04em;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, background .15s ease;
    border:none; cursor:pointer;
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
  }
  .btn-primary{
    background:var(--yellow); color:var(--black);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px); box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(244,193,15,0.25);}
  .btn-outline{
    background:transparent; color:var(--chalk);
    border:1.5px solid var(--line);
  }
  .btn-outline:hover{border-color:var(--chalk); transform:translateY(-2px);}

  /* scoreboard clock — signature element */
  .scoreboard{
    position:relative;
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:28px;
    box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }
  .scoreboard-head{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--chalk-dim);
    padding-bottom:16px;
    border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);
    margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .dot{width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--red); display:inline-block; margin-right:8px; animation:pulse 1.6s infinite;}
  @keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1;} 50%{opacity:0.35;}}
  .clock{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:54px; font-weight:600;
    color:var(--yellow);
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
    text-align:center;
    padding:10px 0 6px;
  }
  .clock-label{
    text-align:center;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.15em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--chalk-dim);
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .stat-row{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:12px;
  }
  .stat{
    background:var(--panel-2);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:14px 8px;
    text-align:center;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
  }
  .stat-num{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:24px; font-weight:600;
    color:var(--chalk);
  }
  .stat-label{
    font-size:10.5px; letter-spacing:0.06em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--chalk-dim);
    margin-top:4px;
  }

  /* ---------- SECTION LABEL SYSTEM ---------- */
  section{padding:104px 0;}
  .sec-label{
    display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:14px;
    margin-bottom:52px;
  }
  .sec-tag{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:13px; font-weight:600;
    color:var(--yellow);
    letter-spacing:0.1em;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .sec-rule{height:1px; background:var(--line); width:100%;}
  .sec-title{
    font-size:clamp(30px, 3.6vw, 46px);
    color:var(--chalk);
  }

  /* ---------- AQUECIMENTO / ABOUT ---------- */
  .about-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.1fr;
    gap:64px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .photo-slot{
    aspect-ratio:4/5;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    background:
      linear-gradient(160deg, #2b2c2f 0%, #1a1b1d 100%);
    border:1px dashed var(--line);
    position:relative;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .photo-slot::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(244,193,15,0.05) 0 2px, transparent 2px 26px);
  }
  .photo-note{
    position:relative; z-index:1;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.06em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--chalk-dim);
    text-align:center; padding:0 24px;
    line-height:1.7;
  }
  .about-copy p{
    font-size:17px; line-height:1.75;
    color:var(--chalk-dim);
    margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .about-copy p strong{color:var(--chalk); font-weight:700;}
  .cred-list{
    margin-top:32px;
    display:grid; gap:14px;
  }
  .cred{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px;
    font-size:14.5px; color:var(--chalk);
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .cred-mark{
    width:26px; height:26px; flex:none;
    background:var(--yellow);
    color:var(--black);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-weight:700; font-size:13px;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
  }

  /* ---------- TREINO / SERVICES ---------- */
  .services-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap:1px;
    background:var(--line);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .service-card{
    background:var(--black);
    padding:40px 32px;
    transition:background .2s ease;
  }
  .service-card:hover{background:var(--panel-2);}
  .service-index{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12.5px; color:var(--yellow);
    margin-bottom:24px;
  }
  .service-card h3{
    font-family:'Anton', sans-serif;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    font-size:24px;
    margin-bottom:14px;
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
  }
  .service-card p{
    color:var(--chalk-dim);
    font-size:15px; line-height:1.7;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .service-tags{
    display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px;
  }
  .service-tags span{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.04em;
    color:var(--chalk-dim);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:5px 10px;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
  }

  /* ---------- CARGA / PRICING ---------- */
  .pricing-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap:24px;
  }
  .plan{
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:36px 30px;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column;
    position:relative;
  }
  .plan.featured{
    border-color:var(--yellow);
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(244,193,15,0.07), var(--panel) 40%);
  }
  .plan-badge{
    position:absolute; top:-13px; left:30px;
    background:var(--yellow); color:var(--black);
    font-size:11px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:0.06em; text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:5px 12px;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
  }
  .plan-name{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--chalk-dim);
    margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .plan-price{
    font-family:'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-size:44px;
    color:var(--chalk);
    margin-bottom:4px;
  }
  .plan-price span{
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size:14px; font-weight:600;
    color:var(--chalk-dim);
    text-transform:none;
  }
  .plan-freq{
    font-size:13px; color:var(--chalk-dim);
    margin-bottom:28px;
  }
  .plan-features{
    list-style:none;
    display:grid; gap:13px;
    margin-bottom:32px;
    flex:1;
  }
  .plan-features li{
    display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:10px;
    font-size:14.5px; color:var(--chalk-dim);
    line-height:1.5;
  }
  .plan-features li::before{
    content:"—";
    color:var(--yellow); font-weight:700; flex:none;
  }
  .plan .btn{width:100%; justify-content:center;}

  /* ---------- RESULTADOS / TESTIMONIALS ---------- */
  .testi-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap:24px;
  }
  .testi{
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:32px 28px;
  }
  .testi-quote{
    font-size:16px; line-height:1.7;
    color:var(--chalk);
    margin-bottom:24px;
  }
  .testi-person{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;
  }
  .avatar{
    width:42px; height:42px; border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--panel-2); border:1px solid var(--line);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-family:'Anton', sans-serif; color:var(--yellow); font-size:15px;
    flex:none;
  }
  .testi-name{font-weight:700; font-size:14px;}
  .testi-result{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:11.5px; color:var(--yellow);
    margin-top:2px;
  }

  /* ---------- CHAMADA / CONTACT ---------- */
  .contact-section{
    background:var(--panel);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .contact-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:64px;
    align-items:start;
  }
  .whatsapp-box{
    background:var(--black);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:36px;
  }
  .whatsapp-box h3{
    font-family:'Anton', sans-serif;
    font-size:26px; text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .whatsapp-box p{
    color:var(--chalk-dim);
    font-size:15px; line-height:1.7;
    margin-bottom:26px;
  }
  .btn-whatsapp{
    background:#25D366; color:#0a0a0a;
    width:100%; justify-content:center;
  }
  .btn-whatsapp:hover{background:#2fe377; transform:translateY(-2px);}
  form{display:grid; gap:16px;}
  .field label{
    display:block;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--chalk-dim);
    margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  .field input, .field select, .field textarea{
    width:100%;
    background:var(--panel-2);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    color:var(--chalk);
    padding:13px 14px;
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size:14.5px;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
  }
  .field input:focus, .field select:focus, .field textarea:focus{
    outline:2px solid var(--yellow);
    outline-offset:1px;
    border-color:var(--yellow);
  }
  .field textarea{resize:vertical; min-height:96px;}
  .form-row{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px;}

  /* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
  footer{padding:56px 0 40px;}
  .footer-grid{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap; gap:24px;
    padding-bottom:32px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    margin-bottom:24px;
  }
  .foot-links{display:flex; gap:28px; font-size:13.5px; color:var(--chalk-dim);}
  .foot-links a:hover{color:var(--chalk);}
  .foot-bottom{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px;
    font-size:12.5px; color:var(--chalk-dim);
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
  }

  /* ---------- RESPONSIVE ---------- */
  @media (max-width: 860px){
    .nav-links{display:none;}
    .hero-grid, .about-grid, .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .services-grid, .pricing-grid, .testi-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    section{padding:72px 0;}
    .hero{padding:64px 0 48px;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <nav>
    <div class="logo">THIAGO<span>.</span>MEIRA</div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#sobre">Aquecimento</a>
      <a href="#servicos">Treino</a>
      <a href="#planos">Carga</a>
      <a href="#resultados">Resultados</a>
      <a href="#contato">Chamada</a>
    </div>
    <a class="nav-cta" href="#contato">Quero treinar</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="stripe"></div>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Personal Trainer · Hipertrofia & Alta Performance</div>
      <h1 class="hero-title display">Seu treino<br>com <span class="accent">método</span>,<br>não com sorte.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Hipertrofia, emagrecimento e performance com acompanhamento individual — presencial em Curitiba ou consultoria online para qualquer lugar do Brasil.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#contato" class="btn btn-primary">Marcar avaliação gratuita</a>
        <a href="#servicos" class="btn btn-outline">Ver como funciona</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="scoreboard">
      <div class="scoreboard-head">
        <span><span class="dot"></span>Sessão em andamento</span>
        <span>SUN 06.09</span>
      </div>
      <div class="clock mono" id="clock">00:00</div>
      <div class="clock-label">Tempo desde o seu último treino. Bora?</div>
      <div class="stat-row">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-num">120+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Alunos</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-num">4</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Anos</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-num">4.9</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Avaliação</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- AQUECIMENTO / ABOUT -->
<section id="sobre">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-label">
      <span class="sec-tag mono">01 · AQUECIMENTO</span>
      <span class="sec-rule"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="photo-slot">
        <div class="photo-note">FOTO DO THIAGO<br>(substituir por imagem real —<br>sugestão: foto em pé, academia, boa luz)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-copy">
        <h2 class="sec-title" style="margin-bottom:24px;">Quem te acompanha na jornada</h2>
        <p><strong>Thiago Meira</strong> é personal trainer formado em Educação Física, com Pós graduação em Nutrição Esportiva e hipertrofia e Biomecânica, com sessões presenciais em Curitiba e consultoria online para alunos em qualquer cidade.</p>
        <p>O trabalho começa antes do treino: entender rotina, histórico, limitações e objetivo real de cada aluno para montar um plano que cabe na vida da pessoa — não o contrário.</p>
        <p>Nada de treino genérico copiado de app. Cada ciclo é ajustado com base na sua evolução, com acompanhamento próximo e ajustes constantes.</p>
        <div class="cred-list">
          <div class="cred"><span class="cred-mark">✓</span> CREF Ativo</div>
          <div class="cred"><span class="cred-mark">✓</span> Especialização em Hipertrofia e Emagrecimento</div>
          <div class="cred"><span class="cred-mark">✓</span> Atendimento presencial (CURITIBA) e online (Brasil)</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TREINO / SERVICES -->
<section id="servicos" style="background:var(--panel-2); border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-label">
      <span class="sec-tag mono">02 · TREINO</span>
      <span class="sec-rule"></span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="sec-title" style="margin-bottom:52px;">Como a gente trabalha</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap" style="padding:0;">
    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-index mono">A</div>
        <h3>Presencial CURITIBA</h3>
        <p>Treino individual acompanhado de perto, execução corrigida em tempo real e ajuste de carga sessão a sessão.</p>
        <div class="service-tags"><span>1x a 5x/semana</span><span>Curitiba e Região Metropolitana</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-index mono">B</div>
        <h3>Consultoria Online</h3>
        <p>Planilha de treino personalizada, app de acompanhamento, check-ins periódicos e suporte direto pelo WhatsApp.</p>
        <div class="service-tags"><span>Qualquer cidade</span><span>Check-in quinzenal</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-index mono">C</div>
        <h3>Avaliação física</h3>
        <p>Diagnóstico completo de composição corporal, mobilidade e histórico para montar o ponto de partida certo.</p>
        <div class="service-tags"><span>Ponto de partida</span><span>Reavaliação mensal</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CARGA / PRICING -->
<section id="planos">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-label">
      <span class="sec-tag mono">03 · CARGA</span>
      <span class="sec-rule"></span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="sec-title" style="margin-bottom:52px;">Planos</h2>
    <div class="pricing-grid">
